§ `s 198: the seam the keel asks (s 4(1) "financial year")`

-- (date of incorporation, first day, last day, last day as furnished under section 19(1)(b), notice under (4), new last day, return or notification lodged before 31 August 2018,
--  last day indicated in it, last day of the previous financial year, months in the regular interval)
-- a company incorporated on 1 March 2019: its first financial year, a subsequent one, and a period that is neither
#ASSERT `s 198 the period is a financial year of the company as section 198 determines` (Date 1 3 2019) (Date 1 3 2019) (Date 31 12 2019) (Date 31 12 2019) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 1 1 2000) 12 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 198 the period is a financial year of the company as section 198 determines` (Date 1 3 2019) (Date 1 1 2020) (Date 31 12 2020) (Date 31 12 2019) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 31 12 2019) 12 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 198 the period is a financial year of the company as section 198 determines` (Date 1 3 2019) (Date 1 3 2019) (Date 30 6 2019) (Date 31 12 2019) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 1 1 2000) 12 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a company incorporated on 1 March 2010 that lodged no return or notification before 31 August 2018: its first year ending on or after that date ends on 1 March 2019,
-- and the next begins on 2 March 2019 and ends on 1 March 2020
#ASSERT `s 198 the period is a financial year of the company as section 198 determines` (Date 1 3 2010) (Date 2 3 2018) (Date 1 3 2019) (Date 1 1 2000) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 1 3 2018) 12 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 198 the period is a financial year of the company as section 198 determines` (Date 1 3 2010) (Date 2 3 2019) (Date 1 3 2020) (Date 1 1 2000) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 1 3 2019) 12 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 198 the period is a financial year of the company as section 198 determines` (Date 1 3 2010) (Date 2 3 2019) (Date 1 9 2019) (Date 1 1 2000) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 1 3 2019) 12 EQUALS JUST FALSE
